<title>UK: INSTANT VIEW - British inflation for June.</title>
<headline>INSTANT VIEW - British inflation for June.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are a selection of analysts' comments on official data showing British headline inflation was 2.9 percent in June -</p>
<p>NIGEL RICHARDSON, HEAD OF BOND RESEARCH AT YAMAICHI INTERNATIONAL EUROPE</p>
<p>&quot;A disappointing set of figures...Petrol prices and motoring costs in general might have been pushing the figure up.&quot;</p>
</text>
